licit non-draft reviewed bilingual release bodies. No publication or release was performed by this PR.\n\n## Evidence\n- `bash -n dcb/tests/Sekiban.Dcb.TemplateValidation/*.sh`: passed.\n- `validate-release-tags.sh --self-test`: passed; exact 26 effective projects.\n- `dotnet build dcb/tests/Sekiban.Dcb.TemplateValidation/Sekiban.Dcb.TemplateValidation.csproj -c Release`: passed, 0 warnings/0 errors.\n- `TemplateValidation source`, `workflow`, `packages`, and `release-record`: passed.\n- Disposable local feed: 26 packages at 10.22.0; package inspection passed for PostgreSQL Relational 9.0.13/10.0.3, Azure Queue dependencies, and Azure-free Orleans Core.\n- `run-packaged-consumer.sh --feed <disposable local feed> --version 10.22.0`: passed; five generated outputs, 11 bundled test projects, current and legacy composition controls, release-record valid states, and all named negative mutants.\n- PostgreSQL project builds: `-f net9.0` and `-f net10.0` passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n\nThe local machine used SDK 11.0.100-preview.3; the source solution built both target frameworks. The mandatory GitHub workflows install the supported .NET 9 and .NET 10 SDKs for CI confirmation. No tags, packages, releases, issue closures, or announcements were created.","created_at":"2026-09-12T23:11:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T04:47:36Z","closed_at":"2026-09-13T04:47:21Z","merged_at":"2026-09-13T04:47:20Z","merge_commit_sha":"7f684e6b9f769d436b12495acd07e7d74c5d8298","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11410886054,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJnSqic8AAAACqCRNpg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/J-Tech-Japan/Sekiban/labels/intent-target","name":"intent-target","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Intent automation target — implementation worker may claim this issue.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":11410886269,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJnSqic8AAAACqCROfQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/J-Tech-Japan/Sekiban/labels/intent-pr-app